2. Exhibits an explicit witness (omega-chain finite truncation) where Q holds and P fails, and where the censorship conclusions separate: SET conclusion false, parent conclusion true.
3. Scans the 6+ documents for direction claims and classifies each as predicate-sense or conclusion-sense, flagging mislabeled/ambiguous ones.

That's a bounded, reproducible artifact with a real falsifier. It's class-bound (AF-WCC-VAC-GEN, variant SET, F1/F2...). It produces evidence for the G-FORM r3 review and adjudicates L-FORM-03/L-FORM-04.

