Implementation:
```python
def local_window(unit, token_line, direction_word, span=140):
    i = unit.find(token_line)
    j = token_line.lower().find(direction_word)
    pos = i + (j if j >= 0 else 0)
    return unit[max(0, pos-span): pos+span]
```
